{"pageProps":{"story":{"name":"Hubert Storyblok CMS Webseite","created_at":"2025-01-27T10:05:06.977Z","published_at":"2025-12-08T13:12:07.088Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T13:12:07.110Z","id":615298801,"uuid":"8d266166-a7d5-49b3-8edc-da3c8c72f7d3","content":{"_uid":"0a50eb47-353c-43a7-93b9-c65698e87178","type":"page","section":[{"_uid":"3f8384e6-fc83-4ef2-b034-480168480b93","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"c7a241aa-3cdc-4b54-ad8c-ba568a0e2694","text":"Der Bochumer Hersteller von Leistungsverstärkern brauchte nach vielen Jahren eine neue Webseite, die den modernen Ansprüchen der Kunden gerecht wird. Mit dem Team von ruhmesmeile wurde Aufbau der Website und die Verwaltung der Inhalte vereinfacht und auf einen Headless Tech-Stack aufgesetzt. Unser modularer Aufbau, basierend auf dem [CMS Website-Accelerator](/headless-cms/cms-website-accelerator), bot die perfekte Lösung.\n\n---","type":"text","align":"center","layout":"singleColumn","component":"text","highlightText":false}],"spaceAfter":"small","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"Zweisprachige Storyblok CMS Website","content_align":"center","content_width":"narrow","headerSpacing":true,"headline_text":"HUBERT Leistungsverstärker","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":true,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"center","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"3442770f-ffa4-4137-a100-555f836ac806","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"2ba0db80-5961-484c-94ea-c6e804b16f22","stat":[{"_uid":"53d74b1f-8c31-4e25-89b0-36a0fb3c6eb5","type":"stat","title":"Storyblok Website","number":"1","component":"stat","description":""},{"_uid":"47b8afbf-2f57-40af-9984-bba239fba91f","type":"stat","title":"Sprachen","number":"2","component":"stat","description":""},{"_uid":"614e8ef4-3439-4356-9e66-a80ee8e9bfea","type":"stat","title":"Lighthouse-Score","number":"98","component":"stat","description":""}],"type":"stats","component":"stats"}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"small","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"21bbd375-adee-429f-843b-7b47fa855e4b","type":"section","style":"accentTransition","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"6cd9a90c-d8b3-43cc-b327-2d9a74c4d005","text":"","type":"hero","height":"fullImage","buttons":[],"overlay":false,"textbox":false,"headline":"","component":"hero","image_alt":"","colorNeutral":false,"image_indent":"","textPosition":"","highlightText":true,"image_srcMobile":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1920x1080/aad12c72c8/showcase_hubert-web-comp.png","image_srcTablet":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1920x1080/aad12c72c8/showcase_hubert-web-comp.png","image_srcDesktop":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1920x1080/aad12c72c8/showcase_hubert-web-comp.png"}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"6f5d486b-5abc-4b36-8e53-ca352ebc3409","type":"section","style":"","width":"max","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"Leichte und angenehme Redaktion von Webinhalten","_uid":"9a0c0324-de99-411f-b93f-2a88ecf25a9f","text":"Die bisherige Website war in die Jahre gekommen. Auf der Suche nach einer neuen State-of-the Art-Lösung war HUBERT schnell klar, dass sie auf Headless Technologie für Ihren Relaunch setzen. Die neue Website sollte pünktlich zur anstehen Messe bereitstehen und dabei alle heute relevanten Metriken zu Barrierefreiheit, Page Speed und SEO-Optimierung beinhalten. Zukünftig soll die Website um verschiedene Drittsysteme erweitert werden.\n\nMit unserem [CMS Website-Accelerator](/headless-cms/cms-website-accelerator) konnten wir alle Anforderungen in-Time und kostengünstig erfüllen.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Die Herausforderung","component":"cta","fullWidth":false,"image_alt":"","textAlign":"center","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"","highlightText":true,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"none","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"accent","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"4db6bee1-39fb-420b-862c-66a6f2aef52a","type":"section","style":"","width":"max","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"f9f17e68-ee80-484c-bae8-34138817ac01","text":"Für das Projekt [drhubert.de](https://www.drhubert.de) setzten wir die leistungsstarken Möglichkeiten von **Storyblok**. Unser Ziel war es, den Kunden zu bemächtigen die eigene Darstellung und die Präsentation der besonderen Produktpalette effizient zu pflegen. Der Einsatz unseres [Website-Accelerators](/design-system-insights/vereinfache-den-switch-zu-headless-cms) ermöglichte es, das Redesign für HUBERT in kürzester Zeit zu integrieren und die Website mit dem Storyblok CMS Starter zügig live zu schalten.\n\nDurch den Einsatz von Storyblok kann HUBERT nun die Inhalte flexibel verwalten und mit den vorkonfigurierten Presets eine schnelle und nahtlose Anpassung von Updates gewährleisten. ","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Lösung und Vorgehen","component":"cta","fullWidth":true,"image_alt":"","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1191x802/1ea9efe5ca/hubert_storyblok_presets.png","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":true,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"none","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"29814330-127c-4d51-99d6-668eacb86d9f","type":"section","style":"","width":"max","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"16d2fe75-dc9e-4fbc-8b55-f4bc8c30a20c","text":"","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"Zwei Screenshot, die im Vergleich einmal die alte und nun die neue drhubert.de Webseite zeigen","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1730x904/0999e295fb/hubert_alt-neu1.png","highlightText":false}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"Aus Alt mach Neu","content_gutter":"large","headline_align":"","headline_large":true,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"accent","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"center","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"68172bb8-7983-4e9b-8d69-2ea1246dcfbc","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"77000905-fcbb-44f7-bdde-d9e9c7dfa56c","text":"Ein wesentlicher Grund von HUBERT, sich für Storyblok zu entscheiden, war die einfache Bedienung und der integrierte visuelle Editor. Der CMS-Starter-Workflow nutzt die  Komponenten des dahinter liegenden Designsystems uns sorgt für die automatische Erstellung von Presets, die im Storyblok Editor verwendet werden können.\n\nDer Redakteur kann sich einfach durch jede Voreinstellung klicken und die Section oder Komponente auswählen, die er verwenden möchte, und sie wird vorausgefüllt eingesetzt.\n\nDas Erstellen, Bearbeiten und Bereitstellen einer Webseite ist damit nur eine Sache von Minuten.","type":"image-story","layout":"textLeft","buttons":[],"padding":false,"headline":"Vordefinierte Presets erleichtern die Arbeit in Storyblok CMS","component":"image-story","image_alt":"Screenshot der Webseite, welche die vordefinierten Presets im Storyblok CMS Backend zeigt","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1191x802/1ea9efe5ca/hubert_storyblok_presets.png","textAlign":"left","image_vAlign":"top","largeHeadline":false,"image_aspectRatio":"unset"}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"large","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"52add920-07c4-47fa-bff0-6bbc3fd82b7f","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"6bda06ca-221d-412d-89c8-294349ad4049","text":"**Storyblok Agentur Services**\n\n- Website-Redesign\n- Technische Konzeption \n- Frontend-Entwicklung ","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true},{"_uid":"1f5aff21-1426-4a85-9ba3-300fdf6aed90","text":"**Technologien**\n\n- [Storyblok CMS](/headless-cms/storyblok-websites)\n- [kickstartDS](/design-system-services/design-system-starterkit-kickstartds)\n- [Storybook](/glossar/storybook)","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true},{"_uid":"6bec0c01-0365-4e4f-9b7b-b0c593d5efca","text":"**Weiterführende Artikel**\n\n- [Switch zu Headless CMS](/design-system-insights/vereinfache-den-switch-zu-headless-cms)\n- [BFSG erklärt ](/glossar/bfsg-barrierefreiheitsstaerkungsgesetz)","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":""},{"_uid":"fecddcb0-e327-49f2-8620-ee1379e4790c","type":"section","style":"","width":"max","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"f8b9a444-c1e5-4a10-88f0-6a81ebc6adac","text":"","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"Zwei Screenshot, die im Vergleich einmal die alte und nun die neue drhubert.de Webseite zeigen","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1730x995/81c0342142/hubert_alt-neu2.png","highlightText":false}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"large","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"center","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"52b4584f-97f1-4604-b795-abfaf72ec91a","type":"section","style":"","width":"max","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"4d94e53e-6014-49ab-9690-e4ea4af3958f","text":"Das Projekt drhubert.de hat durch den Einsatz des **Storyblok CMS Starters** einen bedeutenden Fortschritt erzielt. Die neue zweisprachige Website des Bochumer Herstellers von Leistungsverstärkern wurde rechtzeitig zur Messe gelauncht und erfüllt moderne Anforderungen an Barrierefreiheit, Page Speed und SEO. \n\nDank der Headless-Architektur und der intuitiven Bedienung von Storyblok kann HUBERT Inhalte nun effizient verwalten und schnell aktualisieren. Die Presets im CMS vereinfachen den redaktionellen Prozess erheblich, sodass Anpassungen in kürzester Zeit vorgenommen werden können. \n\nDie Lösung bietet nicht nur eine exzellente Performance, sondern auch die Möglichkeit, die Website zukünftig flexibel zu erweitern.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Impact","component":"cta","fullWidth":true,"image_alt":"Screenshot der Webseite","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1156x1034/81541c0716/hubert_performance.png","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":true,"image_padding":false,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"d735542d-2977-474a-945c-3ee8ed975851","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"998c5c53-ab8a-4606-8d5c-dff9f64cfea7","text":"","type":"teaser-card","image":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1080x810/75a4143d37/wolfcraft_teaser_4zu3.jpg","label":"","lay